  "formula": "Addition of the selected points:\n\n| Variable | Points | |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Age, years | <40 | 0 |\n| ≥40 | 1.5 | |\n| Gender | Male | 1 |\n| Female | 0 | |\n| Indication | Pancreatitis | 0 |\n| Colic, dyskinesia, or polyp | 0.5 | |\n| Common bile duct stone | 2 | |\n| Acalculous or cholecystitis | 2.5 | |\n| [BMI](nabda:calc.body-mass-index-bmi-body-surface-area-bsa\\) | <25 | 0 |\n| 25-35 | 1 | |\n| >35 | 2 | |\n| Common bile duct diameter | Normal | 0 |\n| Dilated | 2 | |\n| Gallbladder wall | Normal | 0 |\n| Thick | 1.5 | |\n| Pre-operative CT done | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 1.5 | |\n| Intra-op cholangiogram planned | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 3 | |\n| Number of previous surgical admissions | 0 | 0 |\n| 1-2 | 1 | |\n| >2 | 2.5 | |\n| [ASA Class](nabda:calc.asa-physical-status-asa-classification\\) | 1 | 0 |\n| 2 | 1 | |\n| >2 | 2.5 | |",
